dates answer_terms v1
description "An answer is due at 17:00 on the second business day after the request"
use calendar "../calendars/weekdays.cal"

inputs
  received : date  range >=2026-01-01 <=2027-12-31

date due = received
  + 2 business days     # the second business day after the request
  at 17:00              # by 17:00

examples
| received   | -> due     |
| 2026-03-31 | 2026-04-02 |
| 2026-04-03 | 2026-04-07 |
